{"id":"mcp:dbhub","type":"mcp","name":"dbhub","displayName":"数据库(DBHub)","description":"只读档访问数据库:读库表结构、执行 SELECT 查询(PostgreSQL / MySQL / MariaDB / SQL Server / SQLite;Bytebase 官方)。连接串经 DSN 环境变量密文采集,不落配置文件。","source":"official","category":"dev","version":"1.0.0","installSpec":{"kind":"mcp","mcpType":"local","command":["npx","-y","@bytebase/dbhub@0.12.0","--transport","stdio","--readonly"],"requiredEnvVars":["DSN"],"runtimeDep":["node"],"mirrorCommand":["npx","-y","--registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com","@bytebase/dbhub@0.12.0","--transport","stdio","--readonly"],"_verify":"版本钉 0.12.0 的理由(2026-07-06 源码核实,S23/E6):这是最后支持 --readonly CLI 档的版本(0.13.0 起只读改走 TOML 配置文件,catalog 安装链无 TOML 物化通道 → 取零机械只读;0.12.0 未被 npm deprecate,代价=放弃 0.13.0+ 修复)。DSN 支持环境变量注入(src/config/env.ts resolveDSN:--dsn > process.env.DSN),密钥经 {file:} 通道不落盘明文。0.12.0 的 readonly 语义(SELECT 类白名单)与 Node 版本下限未逐项核实 → 真机安装 + SELECT/写拒绝走查待验。"},"curation":{"schema":"alpha.catalog.curation.v1","tier":"connector","activationPolicy":"default-disabled","deliveryMode":"installable","review":{"reviewedAt":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","reviewedBy":"jinjunnn","upstreamStatus":"active","supportTier":"community","reviewBefore":"2027-01-18T00:00:00Z"},"applicability":{"frameworks":["*"]},"summaries":{"capabilities":["env:read","fs:read","net:http"],"networkDomains":["api.star-history.com","contrib.rocks","creativecommons.org","database.windows.net","dbhub.ai","github.com","raw.githubusercontent.com","reactjs.org","reactrouter.com","www.bytebase.com","www.cs.aau.dk","www.w3.org"],"requiredSecrets":[{"name":"DB_PASSWORD","source":"environment"},{"name":"SSH_KEY","source":"environment"},{"name":"SSH_PASSWORD","source":"environment"}],"runtimeDependencies":["node"],"download":{"bytes":null,"basis":"unknown"}},"refs":{"sbom":{"sha256":"afcc8fb456cbd0e7163744b23d3f7f2cb2f922e390782b67ed98dd084c5d2dc9","bytes":248,"url":"https://codepuppy.cn/catalog/assets/mcp.dbhub/1.0.0/alpha-curation/sbom/afcc8fb456cbd0e7163744b23d3f7f2cb2f922e390782b